{"obsah":"<p>Martin Šimůnek is as busy as at the start of his career, so once again Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček was called up; he took Matouš Balík and his three offspring and set off for the children's day organised by the Municipal Police in Most. Lots of attractions and the pleasant setting of the children's traffic playground attracted relatively many visitors.</p>\n\n<p>The boys and girls came on at the very end of the event. First they jumped for the local TV, then they started the exhibition, which included crashes and a bit of blood. Simply an adrenaline show. Fortunately it was only a scraped knee and some scratches on the shins. Thanks to Martin and the Municipal Police for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F4C0CA171-3337-4655-8596-FEEA35BF236E.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F4C0CA171-3337-4655-8596-FEEA35BF236E.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209015\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5520.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5520.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209013\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_2840.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_2840.webp?alt=media\